  message: "Concrete nim finding, 2026-09-25 staleness audit: _find_enclosing_proc_nim drops every call made from an exported proc (proc a*), because the name sits in an exported_symbol node with no direct identifier child. Filed as WI-bujar (P2) with a repro. It is a reach loss, which this row's step 2 (assert reach first) would catch. The containment check for nim still belongs to this row."  # e90d
